A quick search on the net tells that this RAID controller is not supported
by OpenBSD.

NetBSD and FreeBSD support it using the mlx(4) driver (writen by Michael
Smith, msmith@freebsd.org and ported to NetBSD by Andrew Doran,
ad@netbsd.org). Apparently nobody has ported this driver to OpenBSD.

I guess you're stuck with NetBSD or FreeBSD for the moment. Or you could
try to hang your disks at the QLogic PCI SCSI controller (detected by the
isp(4), in the dmesg of your previous email).


Cheers,

Dries

